From 75fed98ba7b1ab8ac3937a667aefe5a5bf9cc6f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: baverrr <342259467+baverrr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 20:23:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: Make Legal information work without a browser

- Third-party licenses: HTMLViewer only opens content:// URIs, and only
  unzips file:// ones, so the file:// link to NOTICE.html.gz found no
  viewer. Unzip the notice into the cache, which our FileProvider
  shares, and open that instead.
- LineageOS legal: when nothing can open ro.lineagelegal.url, show an
  offline copy of lineageos.org/legal from res/raw in HTMLViewer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I5f5e8174d283e1168b386da4103d764f9434df27
---
 res/raw/lineage_legal.html                    | 113 ++++++++++++++++++
 src/com/android/settings/LegalSettings.java   |  44 +++++++
 .../settings/SettingsLicenseActivity.java     |  34 +++++-
 3 files changed, 190 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 res/raw/lineage_legal.html

diff --git a/res/raw/lineage_legal.html b/res/raw/lineage_legal.html
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..d5d0af5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/res/raw/lineage_legal.html
@@ -0,0 +1,113 @@
